SUMMARY:Diabetes Support Group
DTSTAMP:20260813T094915Z
DTSTART:20260930T110000Z
DESCRIPTION:Learn about helpful resources while connecting with a community
	 of new friends who understand the unique challenges of managing diabetes.
	 Join us for companionship\, understanding\, and emotional support in a sa
	fe and welcoming environment.\n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/diabe
	tes-support-group/2026-09-30/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
